 PR Pulse · Review │ 9 PRs                          user · not approved │ ↻ 18s
 ★2 code owner  ↩1 waiting on author
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 MARKS (left of the PR number)
 ★        yellow      a team of yours is a requested code owner
 ↩        dim row     you requested changes; no push since

 DETAILS (␣ on a PR)
 ✓ ✗ ◐                CI: passing, failing, running
 ✓ ✗ · ○              reviewer: approved, changes, commented, pending

 KEYS
 j/k ↑/↓              move
 ␣                    details on a PR, fold on a group
 h/l ←/→              fold/unfold group
 o                    open PR in browser
 r                    refresh
 g                    group by user / repo
 a                    not approved / approved
 ?                    help (close with ? or Esc)
 q                    quit







────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 j/k scroll  ? or Esc close  q quit
